="font-medium">解锁完整5大会员权益：</li><li class="flex items-start"><i class="fas fa-check text-green-500 mt-1 mr-2"></i><span>信息流搜索模式</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><i class="fas fa-check text-green-500 mt-1 mr-2"></i><span>智能关键词</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><i class="fas fa-check text-green-500 mt-1 mr-2"></i><span>自定义评论概率</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><i class="fas fa-check text-green-500 mt-1 mr-2"></i><span>智能优先评论策略</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><i class="fas fa-check text-green-500 mt-1 mr-2"></i><span>支持切换3个平台账号/天/个小薯条进阶会员用户账号</span></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><span class="text-sm text-gray-500">备注</span><ul class="mt-2 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><li class="flex items-start"><i class="fas fa-info-circle text-blue-500 mt-1 mr-2"></i><span>一月一付，无自动扣款</span></li></ul></div></div><a class="block w-full py-3 bg-gray-800 text-white rounded-xl hover:bg-gray-700 transition text-center font-bold mt-auto" href="#faq">立即开通</a></div></div><div class="mt-20"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-12"><div class="flex flex-col items-center"><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3"><span class="relative inline-block px-2"><span class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-2 h-3 bg-secondary/50 -z-10"></span><span>点数包</span></span></h2><span class="text-primary font-bold text-lg md:text-xl mb-2">灵活补充点数</span><p class="text-base text-gray-600 text-center max-w-2xl">为会员用户提供灵活的点数补充方案，点数用完前长期有效</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 border border-gray-100 flex flex-col"><div class="flex-grow"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-gray-800">基础</h3><div class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-baseline"><span>¥10</span></div><div class="mb-6"><div class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800">1000点</div><div class="text-sm text-gray-500">长期有效，用完为止</div></div></div><a class="block w-full py-3 bg-gray-800 text-white rounded-xl hover:bg-gray-700 transition text-center font-bold mt-auto" href="#faq">立即购买</a></div><div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 border border-gray-100 flex flex-col"><div class="flex-grow"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-gray-800">标准</h3><div class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-baseline"><span>¥37.5</span></div><div class="mb-6"><div class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800">5000点</div><div class="text-sm text-gray-500">长期有效，用完为止</div></div></div><a class="block w-full py-3 bg-gray-800 text-white rounded-xl hover:bg-gray-700 transition text-center font-bold mt-auto" href="#faq">立即购买</a></div><div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 border border-gray-100 flex flex-col"><div class="flex-grow"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-gray-800">进阶</h3><div class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-baseline"><span>¥75</span></div><div class="mb-6"><div class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800">15000点</div><div class="text-sm text-gray-500">长期有效，用完为止</div></div></div><a class="block w-full py-3 bg-gray-800 text-white rounded-xl hover:bg-gray-700 transition text-center font-bold mt-auto" href="#faq">立即购买</a></div></div></div></div><div style="position:fixed;z-index:9999;top:16px;left:16px;right:16px;bottom:16px;pointer-events:none"></div></section><section id="faq" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-4"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-16"><div class="flex flex-col items-center"><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3"><span class="relative inline-block px-2"><span class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-2 h-3 bg-secondary/50 -z-10"></span><span>常见问题</span></span></h2><span class="text-primary font-bold text-lg md:text-xl mb-2">解答疑惑</span><p class="text-base text-gray-600 text-center max-w-2xl">我们整理了用户最常问的问题，希望能帮助您解决疑惑</p></div></div><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6"><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex justify-between items-start"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 flex items-center"><i class="fas fa-question-circle text-primary mr-3"></i>为什么我不能直接在官网购买会员？</h3><div class="w-8 h-8 bg-gray-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down text-gray-500"></i></div></div><div class="mt-4 text-gray-600 pl-8"><p class="mb-4">需要先登录小薯条账号获取您的账户信息才能准确发放会员权益，直接在官网点击「立即开通」将无法识别账号。</p><p class="mb-3 font-medium">每次购买会员计划或充值点数包，都请按以下步骤操作：</p><ul class="space-y-2 ml-4"><li>• 打开小薯条插件并登录账号</li><li>• 点击插件主页右上角个人中心按钮，点击&quot;成为会员/查看权益&quot;进入官网会员计划页面，点击&quot;去充值&quot;进入官网点数包充值页面</li><li>• 自行选择套餐，点击&quot;立即开通/立即购买&quot;完成支付</li><li>• 重新进入插件，查看您的会员状态和点数余额变化，如有问题请及时通过邮件与我们取得联系</li></ul></div></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex justify-between items-start"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 flex items-center"><i class="fas fa-question-circle text-primary mr-3"></i>插件安全吗？</h3><div class="w-8 h-8 bg-gray-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down text-gray-500"></i></div></div><div class="mt-4 text-gray-600 pl-8">是的，小薯条插件在用户浏览器本地运行，不上传任何用户隐私或账号信息。后台agent智能执行操作，已设置默认节奏限制，建议每日使用时长不超过120分钟，以确保行为合理自然。</div></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex justify-between items-start"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 flex items-center"><i class="fas fa-question-circle text-primary mr-3"></i>如何确保评论的质量？</h3><div class="w-8 h-8 bg-gray-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down text-gray-500"></i></div></div><div class="mt-4 text-gray-600 pl-8">评论由 AI 根据内容语境和用户偏好生成，风格自然，支持自定义主旨/后缀/情感风格，也可完全交由系统自动生成。我们避免使用模板内容，确保评论多样且真实，不会被误判为灌水。</div></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex justify-between items-start"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 flex items-center"><i class="fas fa-question-circle text-primary mr-3"></i>有没有更便宜的会员计划？</h3><div class="w-8 h-8 bg-gray-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down text-gray-500"></i></div></div><div class="mt-4 text-gray-600 pl-8">基础功能免费试用，每日可执行一次内容互动任务，足以体验核心能力。我们提供一次性购买的「尝鲜包」，仅需 ¥9.9，单账号解锁全部会员功能且加赠1500点数，用于完整体验插件的核心能力。</div></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex justify-between items-start"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 flex items-center"><i class="fas fa-question-circle text-primary mr-3"></i>如何在不同平台使用？</h3><div class="w-8 h-8 bg-gray-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down text-gray-500"></i></div></div><div class="mt-4 text-gray-600 pl-8">插件已拆分为两个独立版本，分别支持两个主流社交内容平台（如图文类/短视频类），用户可根据需要单独安装。会员等级统一，点数共享，使用体验一致但逻辑独立，确保合规。</div></div></div><div class="flex justify-center mt-12"><a href="mailto:contact@fsotool.com" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 rounded-xl hover:bg-gray-200 transition"><i class="fas fa-envelope mr-2"></i>还有其他问题？联系我们获取帮助</a></div></div></section><footer class="bg-gray-900 text-white py-16"><div class="container mx-auto px-4"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12"><div><div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-6"><img alt="小薯条 Logo" loading="lazy" width="32" height="32" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-8" style="color:transparent" src="/img/logo.svg"/><span class="text-xl font-bold">小薯条</span></div><p class="text-gray-400 mb-6">小红书/抖音 AI 涨粉神器，让您的账号轻松获得更多曝光和粉丝</p><p class="text-gray-400 mb-2">官方网站：<a href="https://fsotool.com" target="_blank" class="text-primary hover:underline">fsotool.com</a></p><div class="flex space-x-4"><a href="mailto:contact@fsotool.com" class="w-10 h-10 bg-gray-800 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-primary transition-all"><i class="fas fa-envelope text-lg"></i></a><a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/小薯条-小红书抖音-ai-涨粉神器/ddgooekaaihgnbfbgalfiooiicdnmnia" target="_blank" class="w-10 h-10 bg-gray-800 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-primary transition-all"><i class="fab fa-chrome text-lg"></i></a></div></div><div><h4 class="text-lg font-bold mb-6 text-white">快速链接</h4><ul class="space-y-3"><li><a href="#features" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition">核心功能</a></li><li><a href="#advantages" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition">产品优势</a></li><li><a href="#usage" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition">使用步骤</a></li><li><a href="#pricing" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition">会员方案</a></li><li><a href="#faq" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition">常见问题</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class="text-lg font-bold mb-6 text-white">联系方式</h4><ul class="space-y-3"><li class="flex items-center text-gray-400"><i class="fas fa-envelope mr-3"></i><span>contact@fsotool.com</span></li><li class="flex items-center text-gray-400"><i class="fas fa-globe mr-3"></i><a href="https://chipup.fsotool.com" target="_blank" class="hover:text-white transition">chipup.fsotool.com</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class="text-lg font-bold mb-6 text-white">安装插件</h4><div class="space-y-3"><div class="relative"><button id="footer-store-btn" type="button" class="flex w-full items-center px-5 py-3 bg-primary text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-primary/90 transition shadow-md hover:shadow-lg"><i class="fab fa-chrome mr-2"></i>应用商店下载<svg class="ml-auto w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></button><div id="footer-store-dropdown" class="hidden absolute z-50 w-full mt-2 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-2xl border border-gray-